{"schemaVersion":1,"id":230,"sections":[{"id":"358003-PROLOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战前","scripts":[20548],"start":0,"count":34},{"id":"358003-EPILOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战后","scripts":[20549],"start":34,"count":8}],"frames":[{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"358003-PROLOGUE:20548:1","scriptId":20548,"text":"我们采集了一些钢制蛛丝并把虫茧和狼蛛幼崽一并带回了波西娅所在的帐篷。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"358003-PROLOGUE:20548:2","scriptId":20548,"text":"拨开波西娅的帐篷——","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358003-PROLOGUE:20548:3","scriptId":20548,"text":"“哟，回来啦，比我想象中的要快嘛。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":608,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"358003-PROLOGUE:20548:4","scriptId":20548,"text":"一看到我波西娅立刻站了起来，接着她就看到了佩妮她们搬入帐篷的东西。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":608,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358003-PROLOGUE:20548:5","scriptId":20548,"text":"“恩~不错不错，这难道是机甲狼蛛的茧！？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":608,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358003-PROLOGUE:20548:6","scriptId":20548,"text":"“是的，我们顺便还带回了一些蛛丝的样本，你看看是不是你要找的类型。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"358003-PROLOGUE:20548:7","scriptId":20548,"text":"看到波西娅满脸兴奋的样子，我淡淡地的回答道。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358003-PROLOGUE:20548:8","scriptId":20548,"text":"“恩，我马上开始研究。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358003-PROLOGUE:20548:9","scriptId":20548,"text":"“那这任务……我们是不是可以先休息一下了？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358003-PROLOGUE:20548:10","scriptId":20548,"text":"“任务还没完成呢，不过先休息下好了，一个小时后妮科尔就会回来了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358003-PROLOGUE:20548:11","scriptId":20548,"text":"“妮科尔？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"358003-PROLOGUE:20548:12","scriptId":20548,"text":"又一次听到这个有些熟悉的名字，但我实在想不起她是谁。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358003-PROLOGUE:20548:13","scriptId":20548,"text":"“空钢的测试飞行员啊，这次我调她来协助我搜索机甲狼蛛。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358003-PROLOGUE:20548:14","scriptId":20548,"text":"“哦，是她啊，有点印象。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"358003-PROLOGUE:20548:15","scriptId":20548,"text":"就在这时，帐篷外传来了螺旋桨引擎的声音。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358003-PROLOGUE:20548:16","scriptId":20548,"text":"“说来就来啊，比预定的时间要快嘛，你们两边都很出色啊。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"358003-PROLOGUE:20548:17","scriptId":20548,"text":"由于大量气流的卷动，空气透过帐篷的边缘蹿了进来。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"358003-PROLOGUE:20548:18","scriptId":20548,"text":"随带着气流的躁动，帐篷的帘子又一次被掀开了。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":811,"speaker":"妮科尔·奥尔巴赫","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358003-PROLOGUE:20548:19","scriptId":20548,"text":"“报告，已经发现机甲狼蛛的新巢。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":608,"right":811,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358003-PROLOGUE:20548:20","scriptId":20548,"text":"“很好，很效率，我喜欢。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":608,"right":811,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"358003-PROLOGUE:20548:21","scriptId":20548,"text":"波西娅接过妮科尔手里的地图并转交到了我的手里。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":608,"right":811,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358003-PROLOGUE:20548:22","scriptId":20548,"text":"“我想你们该出发了~”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":608,"right":811,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358003-PROLOGUE:20548:23","scriptId":20548,"text":"“诶！？不是说好休息一下的吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358003-PROLOGUE:20548:24","scriptId":20548,"text":"“好吧，那就补给一下再出发好了，但不要拖延时间。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"358003-PROLOGUE:20548:25","scriptId":20548,"text":"波西娅抱起虫茧和狼蛛幼崽，她的注意力已经完全集中到这两样东西上了。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"358003-PROLOGUE:20548:27","scriptId":20548,"text":"我们小队和妮科尔一起出了帐篷后，妮科尔主动向我们打了招呼。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":811,"speaker":"妮科尔·奥尔巴赫","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358003-PROLOGUE:20548:28","scriptId":20548,"text":"“你们好啊，有些日子不见了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":811,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358003-PROLOGUE:20548:29","scriptId":20548,"text":"“恩，真没想到会在这里见到你，空钢已经投入实战了？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":811,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":811,"speaker":"妮科尔·奥尔巴赫","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358003-PROLOGUE:20548:30","scriptId":20548,"text":"“没呢~是波西娅博士让我进行外出测试。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":811,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358003-PROLOGUE:20548:31","scriptId":20548,"text":"“波西娅的职权真广……看来你也挺辛苦的。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":811,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":813,"speaker":"妮科尔·奥尔巴赫","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358003-PROLOGUE:20548:32","scriptId":20548,"text":"“还好啦~翱翔于天空的感觉我很喜欢。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":813,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":811,"speaker":"妮科尔·奥尔巴赫","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358003-PROLOGUE:20548:33","scriptId":20548,"text":"“不过尝试运送尤拉的时候遇到了不小的麻烦……运送艾丽莎倒是没问题。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":811,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358003-PROLOGUE:20548:34","scriptId":20548,"text":"“怪不得没有看到尤拉和艾丽莎，是载重测试？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":811,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":811,"speaker":"妮科尔·奥尔巴赫","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358003-PROLOGUE:20548:35","scriptId":20548,"text":"“是的，本来打算把尤拉和艾丽莎用吊绳送往另一处补给营地的，结果差点连起飞都失败……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":811,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"358003-EPILOGUE:20549:1","scriptId":20549,"text":"根据妮科尔的地图，我们发现了一处机甲狼蛛的巢穴。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":811,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"358003-EPILOGUE:20549:2","scriptId":20549,"text":"不过和之前一样，机甲狼蛛受惊之后就立刻逃跑了。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":811,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358003-EPILOGUE:20549:3","scriptId":20549,"text":"“白跑一趟，连狼蛛的腿毛都没捞到……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":4,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":740,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358003-EPILOGUE:20549:4","scriptId":20549,"text":"“唉……让妮科尔找不就好了嘛，她能飞视野也比我们广阔。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":584,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358003-EPILOGUE:20549:5","scriptId":20549,"text":"“我们的任务是捕获机甲狼蛛，妮科尔只能做侦察，她连尤拉都拖不动，机甲狼蛛就更没戏了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":584,"right":740,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":740,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358003-EPILOGUE:20549:6","scriptId":20549,"text":"“唉……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":584,"right":740,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358003-EPILOGUE:20549:7","scriptId":20549,"text":"“往好处想吧，省得我们在林子里转悠，有事先准备的地图就不错了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":572,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358003-EPILOGUE:20549:8","scriptId":20549,"text":"“捕获工作还是交给我们做更合适，不然都让别人做了，我们可就要失业了呀~”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-01.webp","left":4,"right":572,"section":1,"shake":false}],"summaries":[]}
